---
// Why scaling sluggish pods inflates both cloud bills and tail latency waterfalls + 3 anti-patterns.
const W = 900;
const H = 284;
---
<figure class="ge8a">
  <div class="ge8a-scroll">
    <svg viewBox={`0 0 ${W} ${H}`} role="img" aria-label="Diagram comparing naive horizontal pod auto-scaling which amplifies cloud cost and fan-out tail latency against systematic RAER-driven Go optimization.">
      {/* Left panel: Scaling slow code fallacy */}
      <rect x="14" y="14" width="440" height="256" rx="10" class="ge8a-card is-red" />
      <text x="30" y="42" class="ge8a-h-red">
        <tspan data-lang-en>1. The "Just Add More Pods" Trap</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>1. Cái bẫy "Chậm thì thêm Pod Kubernetes"</tspan>
      </text>

      <rect x="30" y="60" width="408" height="62" rx="6" class="ge8a-box" />
      <text x="44" y="80" class="ge8a-b">Slow Go handler: 400 MB RAM + 180 ms p99 GC stalls</text>
      <text x="44" y="99" class="ge8a-m">
        <tspan data-lang-en>10 pods multiply cloud cost 10x, yet requests still stall 180 ms!</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Nhân 10 pod thì hóa đơn x10, nhưng mỗi request vẫn chậm 180 ms!</tspan>
      </text>

      <rect x="30" y="132" width="408" height="62" rx="6" class="ge8a-box" />
      <text x="44" y="152" class="ge8a-b">Fan-out p99 compounding: 1 API calls 10 slow pods</text>
      <text x="44" y="171" class="ge8a-m">
        <tspan data-lang-en>1 - 0.99^10 ≈ 9.6% of page loads hit a tail GC pause or CFS throttle.</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Xác suất vấp p99 đội lên ~9.6%: gần 1/10 người dùng bị khựng đuôi!</tspan>
      </text>

      <rect x="30" y="204" width="408" height="50" rx="6" class="ge8a-box is-red" />
      <text x="44" y="224" class="ge8a-b-red">Hardware shifted: single-core speed plateaued ~2005</text>
      <text x="44" y="241" class="ge8a-m">Vendors add slower cores, pushing efficiency back onto Go code.</text>

      {/* Right panel: Three classic efficiency traps */}
      <rect x="470" y="14" width="416" height="256" rx="10" class="ge8a-card" />
      <text x="486" y="42" class="ge8a-h">
        <tspan data-lang-en>2. Three Engineering Anti-Patterns to Drop</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>2. Ba thói quen sai lầm khiến tối ưu phản tác dụng</tspan>
      </text>

      <rect x="486" y="60" width="384" height="58" rx="6" class="ge8a-box" />
      <text x="500" y="80" class="ge8a-b">Trap A: Premature / Blind Micro-Optimization</text>
      <text x="500" y="99" class="ge8a-m">
        <tspan data-lang-en>Writing unsafe/pools before checking whether path is hot.</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Nhét mẹo khó đọc vào đoạn code cả ngày mới chạy 1 lần.</tspan>
      </text>

      <rect x="486" y="128" width="384" height="58" rx="6" class="ge8a-box" />
      <text x="500" y="148" class="ge8a-b">Trap B: "Optimization Is Only Assembly Tricks"</text>
      <text x="500" y="167" class="ge8a-m">
        <tspan data-lang-en>Biggest 10x gains come from batching &amp; dropping steps.</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Mức tăng 10x thật sự đến từ cắt bước thừa &amp; sửa luồng data.</tspan>
      </text>

      <rect x="486" y="196" width="384" height="58" rx="6" class="ge8a-box is-ok" />
      <text x="500" y="216" class="ge8a-b-ok">Antidote: Data-Driven RAER + TFBO Discipline</text>
      <text x="500" y="235" class="ge8a-m">
        <tspan data-lang-en>Measure → fix #1 bottleneck → prove speedup cleanly.</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Chốt ngân sách → đo đúng chỗ nghẽn → chứng minh số liệu.</tspan>
      </text>
    </svg>
  </div>
  <figcaption>
    <span data-lang-en>Horizontal scaling hides bad efficiency behind higher cloud bills without fixing tail latency; disciplined efficiency starts by eliminating guesswork and premature tricks.</span>
    <span data-lang-vi>Tăng thêm pod chỉ trả tiền che triệu chứng chứ không giảm được độ trễ đuôi của từng request; tối ưu bài bản giúp cả hệ thống nhanh hơn lẫn rẻ hơn mà code vẫn sạch.</span>
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .ge8a { margin: 2em 0; width: 100%; }
  .ge8a-scroll { overflow-x: auto; }
  .ge8a svg { display: block; width: 100%; min-width: 640px; height: auto; }
  .ge8a text { font-size: 12px; fill: var(--text-body); font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
  .ge8a-card { fill: var(--bg-alt); stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1.5; }
  .ge8a-card.is-red { fill: var(--red-tint-bg); stroke: var(--red); }
  .ge8a-box { fill: var(--bg); stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1.2; }
  .ge8a-box.is-red { stroke: var(--red); }
  .ge8a-box.is-ok { stroke: rgb(21, 128, 61); }
  :global(html[data-theme='dark']) .ge8a-box.is-ok { stroke: rgb(74, 222, 128); }
  .ge8a-h { font-size: 14px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .ge8a-h-red { font-size: 14px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--red); }
  .ge8a-b { font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .ge8a-b-red { font-weight: 700; fill: var(--red); }
  .ge8a-b-ok { font-weight: 700; fill: rgb(21, 128, 61); }
  :global(html[data-theme='dark']) .ge8a-b-ok { fill: rgb(74, 222, 128); }
  .ge8a-m { fill: var(--text-muted); font-size: 11px; }
  .ge8a figcaption { margin-top: 10px; font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.55; text-align: center; }
</style>
